[b]Cabin Chair Marker[/b]

Mark the chair assigned to your local player in the cabin game. Blood decals are the default; a bloody cross or circle is also available. This is a small UE4SS Lua mod with a settings file and three hotkeys.

[b]Alpha status[/b]
This release is version 0.1.0-alpha. Real engine-component and connected local IP-client checks passed, including removal of old markers and non-replication. Tests used a controlled chair assignment. Visible decal placement and the natural seating flow in a complete four-player Steam round have not yet been confirmed. An isolated screenshot test reported a GPU crash; that observation is not proof that the Lua mod caused it. Do not treat this file as a stable compatibility release.

[b]Features[/b]
[list]
[*]Local cosmetic marking of your assigned chair.
[*]Blood, bloody cross or bloody circle styles.
[*]Configurable size and separate seat/backrest placement.
[*]F6: enable/disable. F7: cycle styles. F8: reload the settings file.
[*]No server-side installation required; the host and other players do not need the mod.
[*]No save edits or gameplay RPCs. Materials are loaded from your installed game; no game assets are bundled.
[/list]

No marker appears until the game assigns a chair. The marker follows that assignment; standing up does not remove it while the assignment remains. A changed or cleared assignment removes the previous marker.

[b]Requirements[/b]
Windows Steam edition of the cabin game and UE4SS. The tested combination is game build 25553694 / Unreal 5.5 and UE4SS v3.0.1-1164-g5e627997. Other combinations are not confirmed. The loader is a separate download and is not included in this package.
[url=https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS/releases/tag/experimental-latest]UE4SS experimental releases[/url] — select the tested build when available; newer builds are not automatically confirmed.

[b]Installation[/b]
Close the game. Install a compatible UE4SS loader first. Copy the archive's Mods/CabinChairMarker folder to the_cabin_game/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/CabinChairMarker under your game installation. The included enabled.txt activates this mod without replacing a shared mods.txt. Preserve your existing loader configuration. Start the game.

[b]Settings[/b]
Edit ue4ss/Mods/CabinChairMarker/Scripts/settings.lua:
[code]return {
    enabled = true,
    style = "blood", -- "blood", "cross", "circle"
    size = 18,       -- 5..30, half-width in Unreal units
    seat = true,
    back = true,
}[/code]
F6/F7 apply to the current session. The file determines the next launch; F8 reapplies its settings immediately. Invalid reloads retain the current settings and report an error in the UE4SS log. The built-in styles are red; arbitrary colors are not supported.

[b]Uninstall[/b]
Close the game and remove only ue4ss/Mods/CabinChairMarker. Use F6 to turn it off during a session. Removing enabled.txt disables it on the next launch unless it was also explicitly enabled in mods.txt.

